# Innocent Bystander: "Whenever this creature is dealt 3 or more damage, investigate." Attacking on turn 3, it is blocked by
# three Memnites that each deal it 1 at once (CR 510.2): no single source reaches 3 but the combat damage dealt together
# does, so it triggers, once (CR 603.2c). The Bystander kills two Memnites and dies; Bot1 keeps the Clue.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Innocent Bystander
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite x3
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Innocent Bystander.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite#1.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite#1.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Innocent Bystander > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite#1 > Innocent Bystander; Memnite#2 > Innocent Bystander; Memnite#3 > Innocent Bystander)
Bot1.AssignDamage(Innocent Bystander > Memnite#1: 1; Innocent Bystander > Memnite#2: 1)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mox Ruby; Clue Token
Bot1.Graveyard = Innocent Bystander
Bot2.Battlefield = Memnite
Stack.Count = 0
